# =============================================================================
# Contact form delivery. Set ANY ONE of the options below (or several — each is
# an independent backup). A submission succeeds if at least one works.
# =============================================================================

# --- Option A (easiest): a form-backend that STORES submissions AND emails you.
# Sign up at https://usebasin.com (or formspree.io / getform.io), create a form,
# and paste its endpoint URL here. Nothing else needed — no DB, no Google setup.
# FORM_ENDPOINT=https://usebasin.com/f/xxxxxxxx

# --- Option B: Resend (email only) ---
# Contact form email delivery (Resend — https://resend.com)
# 1. Create a free Resend account using chanchadharsh4@gmail.com
# 2. Create an API key at https://resend.com/api-keys
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the key below
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Where contact form briefs are delivered (defaults to chanchadharsh4@gmail.com)
# CONTACT_TO=chanchadharsh4@gmail.com

# Sender address. Until you verify your own domain in Resend, leave this unset
# to use Resend's shared onboarding sender. With a verified domain, e.g.:
# CONTACT_FROM=Nexio Contact <hello@yourdomain.com>

# --- Option C: also store every submission in a Google Sheet (backup record) ---
# Follows docs/google-sheet-webhook.gs. Either email or the sheet is enough on
# its own — a submission fails only if BOTH are configured and both fail.
# SHEET_WEBHOOK_URL is the Apps Script web-app URL. SHEET_WEBHOOK_TOKEN is an
# optional shared secret (must match SECRET in the script; leave empty to skip).
# SHEET_WEBHOOK_URL=
# SHEET_WEBHOOK_TOKEN=
